Slot Scout Privacy Policy

Last Updated: October 19, 2026

1. Introduction

Slot Scout respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected, used, and protected when you use the Slot Scout mobile application.

By using Slot Scout, you acknowledge this Privacy Policy.

2. Information We Collect

Depending on the features you use, Slot Scout may collect or process the following information:

Device Information: Information about your device, operating system, and app performance may be processed to maintain functionality and troubleshoot problems.

Location Information: If location permissions are requested and granted, your location may be used to help identify nearby casinos or slot machine locations. You can disable location access through your device settings.

Usage Information: Technical information about app usage may be processed to improve functionality and user experience.

Information You Provide: If you contact us for support, we may receive the information you include in your message.

We do not intentionally collect personal information that is unnecessary to operate the app.

3. How We Use Information

Information may be used to:

- Provide slot machine location information.
- Help users discover nearby locations.
- Improve app performance and functionality.
- Diagnose technical issues.
- Respond to user questions and support requests.
- Maintain the security and reliability of the application.

4. Location Permissions

Slot Scout may use your device's location, if you grant permission, to provide location-related features.

You can manage or revoke location permissions through your Android device settings.

If you deny location permission, certain location-based features may not work as intended.

5. Third-Party Services

Slot Scout may use third-party services to support app hosting, functionality, analytics, advertising, or mapping.

These providers may process certain information according to their own privacy policies.

Third-party services, if used, may include:

- Google Play services.
- Mapping or location services.
- Advertising services, if advertisements are displayed.
- Analytics and diagnostic services, if enabled.

We encourage users to review the privacy policies of any third-party services used within the app.

6. Information Sharing

We do not sell your personal information.

Information may be shared with service providers when necessary to operate the application, or when disclosure is required by law or necessary to protect the security and rights of users.

7. Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information processed through the application.

However, no electronic storage or internet transmission method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

8. Data Retention and Deletion

Information is retained only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this policy, subject to applicable legal requirements.

If you have questions about information associated with your use of Slot Scout, you may contact us using the contact information below.

9. Children's Privacy

Slot Scout is not intended to knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided personal information, please contact us so that the matter can be reviewed.

10. Your Choices

You can control certain permissions through your device settings, including location access.

You may also choose not to provide information when contacting support.

11. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy as the application develops. Updates will be published on the webpage hosting this policy, together with the revised effective date.

12. Contact Information

For privacy questions or requests concerning Slot Scout, contact:

App Name: Slot Scout
Developer: Crystal Tolleson
Contact Email: support@slotspotpro.com

---

This Privacy Policy applies to the Slot Scout mobile application and its associated services.
